<h1>Hydration → Does Not Exist</h1>
<p style="color:var(--ui-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">The problem hydration solves does not arise when the document is complete.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem">
  <div>
    <h3>React Hydration</h3>
    <pre style="background:#1e1e2e;color:#cdd6f4;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8rem;overflow-x:auto;line-height:1.6"><code>// The server renders HTML.
// The client re-renders to attach events.
hydrateRoot(
  document.getElementById('root'),
  &lt;App /&gt;
);
// If server and client output differ:
// "Hydration mismatch" error
// "Uncanny valley" before hydration completes
// Page looks interactive but isn't</code></pre>
    <htx:component src="/ui/alert.htx" variant="warning" title="Failure modes">
      Hydration mismatches. Uncanny valley. Dual rendering environments. The server and client compete to own the DOM.
    </htx:component>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>PRESTO</h3>
    <pre style="background:#1e1e2e;color:#cdd6f4;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8rem;overflow-x:auto;line-height:1.6"><code>&lt;!-- The page is complete HTML. --&gt;
&lt;!-- Links work. Forms submit. --&gt;
&lt;!-- Then scripts enhance: --&gt;

&lt;htx:script&gt;
  // This runs AFTER the document is complete.
  // It enhances. It does not reclaim.
  // No reconciliation. No mismatch possible.
  el.addEventListener('click', function() {
    el.classList.toggle('active');
  });
&lt;/htx:script&gt;</code></pre>
    <htx:component src="/ui/alert.htx" variant="success" title="No hydration">
      There is no hydration step. The concept is absent. The page is interactive when it arrives. Scripts enhance what already works.
    </htx:component>
  </div>
</div>

<h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Live: These components are interactive with no hydration</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem">
  <htx:component src="/ui/card.htx" title="Dialog (no hydration)">
    <htx:component src="/ui/dialog.htx" trigger="Open" title="No Hydration" description="This dialog works immediately">
      <p>No reconciliation needed. The script enhances a complete document.</p>
    </htx:component>
  </htx:component>
  <htx:component src="/ui/card.htx" title="Slider (no hydration)">
    <htx:component src="/ui/slider.htx" label="Interactive" min="0" max="100" value="42" name="demo" />
  </htx:component>
</div>

